{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026OjwWH2Tg5l1793178909.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>應屆香港小姐冠軍袁絲珩早前獲邀出席馬場活動，其後在社交平台上發布了一系列美麗照片，與粉絲分享活動上的璀璨時刻。</p><p></p><p>活動當日，袁絲珩特別盛裝打扮，以一身高雅大方的服飾造型亮麗登場，並佩戴上美麗且時尚的珠寶首飾現身馬場。整體造型唯美典雅，盡顯高貴氣質。她在社交網上發文表示：「閃耀嘅珠寶，記錄每一個璀璨時刻 ✨✨戴上美麗又時尚嘅首飾，見證呢個咁有紀念價值嘅日子。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"e0522b21-d89c-410c-b447-c980a71f7a0a.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026LamU54i7sj1793178908.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"bddb3a21-1855-411b-ac00-ac620e05db0f.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dsZU0IayPR1793178908.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>貼文曝光後，隨即吸引不少網民關注與留言，紛紛讚賞袁絲珩不論衣著還是氣質均「氣質滿滿」，更指她散發出強烈的「女神氣場」，大讚其應屆港姐冠軍的迷人魅力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:37.379374+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.387271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:21.104239+00:00","content_hash":"56a374cfeef65ffb395643ca85e8a7e38d5d37bf234c914b42d5a6aaca0f73ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:37.379374+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}